  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 401.01 Renewal of Licenses. A license for a fighter, manager, referee, judge, cornerman, timekeeper, or scorekeeper shall be renewed by re-applying for a license as prescribed in Box 301.02.\n\nSource. #4420, eff 5-24-88; EXPIRED 5-24-94\n\nNew. #6257, eff 5-25-96, EXPIRED: 5-25-04\n\nNew. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14034 eff 7-30-24",
